            "description_html": "<b>AHI SIG712, Satin Stainless Steel Ball Catch with Square Corners</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBall catches are usually used in conjunction with dummy hardware and installed in the top, bottom, and/or side of the door to hold them closed. The AHI SIG712 has a satin stainless steel finish and comes packaged with strike and mounting hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AHI-SIG712-specifcations.gif?v=1704354573\" width=\"442\" height=\"197\" border=\"0\" alt=\"AHI SIG712 Ball Catch Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the AHI SIG712 Door Ball Catch:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Corner Type: Square</li>\r\n<li>Catch Face Length: 2-3/16\" (54 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Catch Face Width: 1\" (25.5 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Catch Face Depth: 1-9/16\" (39 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate Length: 2-3/16\" (54 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate Width: 1-3/8\" (35 mm)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
